      "slug": "lemongrass-marinade",
      "term": "Lemongrass marinade",
      "definition": "A Vietnamese marinade where lemongrass is finely minced and combined with fish sauce, sugar, garlic, and shallots. The lemongrass infuses the meat with its citrusy, floral fragrance."
    },
    {
      "slug": "nuoc-cham-ribs",
      "term": "Nước chấm",
      "definition": "The Vietnamese dipping sauce of fish sauce, lime juice, sugar, garlic, and chilli. It cuts through the richness of grilled pork and is essential alongside sườn nướng."
    }
  ],
